OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry but cloudy and breezy
OL,6,Fstart. Becoming increasingly windy as
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain, perhaps heavy at
OL,8,Ftimes, spread eastward through the
OL,9,Fafternoon then turning showery later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRemaining cloudy and breezy
OL,12,Fespecially along the coast, evening
OL,13,Fshowers will gradually ease to give
OL,14,Fdrier conditions by the morning.
OL,15,
OL,16,CFriday:FSunny intervals and possible
OL,17,Fisolated showers during the morning,
OL,18,Fbecoming more settled in the afternoon
OL,19,Fand feeling warm as the winds ease.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
