OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fwith heavy rain Saturday. Mostly
OL,7,Fcloudy with occasional showers Sunday.
OL,8,FHeavy rain during the afternoon,
OL,9,Fbecoming breezy. Temperatures trending
OL,10,Fa little above average.
